---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout'
---

<BaseLayout
    title='Contact Us'
    description='Contact GetFOSS by email: how to write an effective message and what to expect from our replies.'
>
    <article class='prose prose-lg md:prose-xl dark:prose-invert min-w-full py-4'>
        <h1>Contact Us</h1>
        <p>
            Contact us at this email address:
            <a href='mailto:admin@getfoss.org'><strong>admin@getfoss.org</strong></a>
        </p>

        <p>Before sending your message, it's important to:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>Clearly specify a topic in the subject line.</li>
            <li>Compose your message with sufficient context.</li>
            <li>Include the link to the guide in question.</li>
            <li>Review our <a href='/privacy-policy/'>privacy policy</a>.</li>
            <li>We won't respond to advertisers at this time.</li>
            <li>We won't respond to guest post requests at this time.</li>
        </ul>

        <p>
            You can also find us on
            <a href='https://x.com/getfoss_org' rel='noopener noreferrer'>X (Twitter)</a>.
        </p>
    </article>
</BaseLayout>
